    "description": "The Everything area above The Parking Lot and Secret Garden is a bit of a hike, but explorers will be rewarded with some excellent problems and plenty of project potential. There are several unknown blocks with project potential on the way up the east side of Bong Eater. Chad's Cave, just northeast of Bong Eater houses loads of fun intermediate and advanced lines on steep and blocky Big Cottonwood style features. Continue up the gully to a nice new elite line 'Elevated Squeezing' and project potential on the nearby Samurai Slabs. At the top of the area is the Everything Boulder with several high quality Advanced and Elite problems on a tall slightly overhanging face with Big Cottonwood style rock. A few large boulders hide potential projects higher on the hill."
