    "description": "The Green Adjective Gully is a newer area up the hill to the east of The Gate. The huge boulders high in the talus are densely packed with excellent problems and lots of projects waiting to be done with expansive views of the canyon. The West Gate zone off the left side of the trail has great problems across the grades from silly moderate 'Far Away Horse' to new intermediate classic 'Knockin' Boots' and the more advanced 'Body Shop' and 'Enter the Brine'. Further up is the daring high ball 'Last First Crack' surrounded by more great problems and potential projects. High on the hill in the talus to the right elite lines can be found like 'Hour of Power', 'Mr. Peanut' and 'The Settlement' as well as loads of excellent intermediates like 'The Fin' and 'The Shield' along with advanced problems like 'Karate Chop Kid', 'Halcyon' and 'Naughty Neighbor'."
